<title>EGYPT: EGYPTIAN COTTON PRICES STEADY FOR NEXT WEEK.</title>
<headline>EGYPTIAN COTTON PRICES STEADY FOR NEXT WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association said on Sunday it would leave cotton export prices unchanged for the coming week, the 48th week of the 96/97 marketing season.</p>
<p>Total export commitments at the end of the first 47 weeks of the season were unchanged at 63,963 tonnes, it added.</p>
<p>The prices, valid until 2100 GMT on August 16, are listed below in centilibres (U.S. cents per lb).</p>
<p>		  FG/EX  FG+1/4   FG   FG-1/4  G/FG  G+3/8</p>
<p>    Giza 76   181.0  175.0  169.0  163.0  157.0  154.0</p>
<p>    Giza 70   174.0  168.0  162.0  156.0  150.0  147.0</p>
<p>    Giza 77   169.0  163.0  157.0  151.0  145.0  142.0</p>
<p>    Giza 75   142.0  136.0  130.0  124.0  118.0  115.0</p>
<p>    Giza 85   131.0  125.0  119.0  113.0  107.0  104.0</p>
<p>    Giza 83   127.0  121.0  115.0  109.0  103.0  100.0</p>
<p>    Giza 80   127.0  121.0  115.0  109.0  103.0  100.0</p>
<p>Note - FG/EX = fully good/excellent, G/FG = good/fully good</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
